\" in test cases for details about the rounding errors."},"initialize(string,string,uint256)":{"details":"Initialize the contract. The contract is designed to be used with OpenZeppelin's      `TransparentUpgradeableProxy`. This function should be called by the proxy's      constructor (via the `_data` argument)."},"initializeV2(address,string,string)":{"details":"Initialize the part added in V2. If this contract is upgraded from the previous      version, call `upgradeToAndCall` of the proxy and put a call to this function      in the `data` argument.      In the previous version, name and symbol were not correctly initialized via proxy."},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"pause()":{"details":"Triggers stopped state. Requirements: - The contract must not be paused."},"paused()":{"details":"Returns true if the contract is paused, and false otherwise."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby removing any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"unpause()":{"details":"Returns to normal state. Requirements: - The contract must be paused."},"veChessCrossChain(uint256,uint16,bytes)":{"params":{"amount":"Amount of locked CHESS","toLzChainID":"Target chain ID"}}},"stateVariables":{"_obsolete_crossChainVotingEscrows":{"details":"[Obsolete] Mapping of chain ID => VotingEscrow address on that chain"},"_reservedSlots":{"details":"Reserved storage slots for future base contract upgrades"}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"calibrateSupply()":{"notice":"Recalculate `nextWeekSupply` from scratch. This function eliminates accumulated         rounding errors in `next